                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "bMXWD",
                      "fill": "#0F1729",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "退潮的第三天，守塔人把梯子从阁楼搬了下来。他说过，潮线不是边界，是记账 —— 每一次偏移都对应着某个纪元的亏欠。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.87,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter, \"Noto Sans SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
